<header><h1>Thunder&rsquo;s Edge revised strategy cards (card text as transcribed on the Twilight Imperium Wiki): Notes</h1></header>
<article>
<p>Every note on this site that <a href="https://twilight-imperium.fandom.com/wiki/Thunder%27s_Edge" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Thunder&rsquo;s Edge revised strategy cards (card text as transcribed on the Twilight Imperium Wiki)</a> supports, with the text it is quoted for, grouped by page. <b>Explicit</b> sources state the note directly. <b>Implicit</b> sources support it without stating it.</p>
<h2><a href="/R_active_system">Active System</a></h2>
<ul>
    <li>(Thunder&rsquo;s Edge) The primary ability of the <i>Warfare</i> strategy card allows a player to perform a tactical action in a system that already contains one of their command tokens, without placing a command token.<sup>13</sup>
        <ul>
        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>13</sup> Warfare (Thunder&rsquo;s Edge), primary: &ldquo;Perform a tactical action in any system without placing a command token, even if the system already has your command token in it; that system still counts as being activated.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
</ul>
<h2><a href="/R_construction">Construction (Strategy Card)</a></h2>
<ul>
    <li>To resolve the primary ability on the <i>Construction</i> strategy card, the active player may either place one structure on a planet they control, or use the <sc>Production</sc> ability of one of their space docks. Then, that player may place one structure on a planet they control.<sup>13</sup>
        <ul>
        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>13</sup> Construction (Thunder&rsquo;s Edge), primary: &ldquo;Either place 1 structure on a planet you control, or use the PRODUCTION ability of 1 of your space docks. Place 1 structure on a planet you control.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
    <li>After the active player resolves the primary ability of the <i>Construction</i> strategy card, each other player, beginning with the player to the left of the active player and proceeding clockwise, may spend one command token from their strategy pool to place one structure on a planet they control. The command token is not placed in any system.<sup>2,13</sup>
        <ul>
        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>13</sup> Construction (Thunder&rsquo;s Edge), secondary: &ldquo;Spend 1 token from your strategy pool to place 1 structure on a planet you control.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
</ul>
<h2><a href="/R_tactical_action">Tactical Action</a></h2>
<ul>
    <li>(Thunder&rsquo;s Edge) The primary ability of the <i>Warfare</i> strategy card allows a player to perform a tactical action in a system that already contains one of their command tokens, without placing a command token.<sup>13</sup>
        <ul>
        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>13</sup> Warfare (Thunder&rsquo;s Edge), primary: &ldquo;Perform a tactical action in any system without placing a command token, even if the system already has your command token in it; that system still counts as being activated.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
</ul>
<h2><a href="/R_warfare">Warfare (Strategy Card)</a></h2>
<ul>
    <li>To resolve the primary ability on the <i>Warfare</i> strategy card, the active player performs the following:<sup>13</sup>
        <ul>
        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>13</sup> Warfare (Thunder&rsquo;s Edge), primary: &ldquo;Perform a tactical action in any system without placing a command token, even if the system already has your command token in it; that system still counts as being activated. You may redistribute your command tokens before and after this action.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
    <li>The active player performs a tactical action in any system without placing a command token, even if the system already has their command token in it; that system still counts as being activated.<sup>2,13</sup>
        <ul>
        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>13</sup> Warfare (Thunder&rsquo;s Edge), primary: &ldquo;Perform a tactical action in any system without placing a command token, even if the system already has your command token in it; that system still counts as being activated.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
    <li>The active player may redistribute their command tokens before and after this tactical action.<sup>2,13</sup>
        <ul>
        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>13</sup> Warfare (Thunder&rsquo;s Edge), primary: &ldquo;You may redistribute your command tokens before and after this action.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
    <li>After the active player resolves the primary ability of the <i>Warfare</i> strategy card, each other player, beginning with the player to the left of the active player and proceeding clockwise, may spend one command token from their strategy pool to resolve the <sc>Production</sc> abilities of units in their home system.<sup>2,13</sup>
        <ul>
        <li><b>Explicit</b>: <sup>13</sup> Warfare (Thunder&rsquo;s Edge), secondary: &ldquo;Spend 1 token from your Strategy Pool to use the PRODUCTION abilities of units in your home system.&rdquo;</li>
        </ul></li>
</ul>
</article>
